------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project parses and analyzes shot-by-shot data from the
Match Charting Project by Jeff Sackmann / Tennis Abstract:

    https://github.com/JeffSackmann/tennis_MatchChartingProject

That dataset is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The dataset is NOT redistributed in this repository. It is fetched
locally by scripts/fetch_mcp_data.sh into a git-ignored data/ directory.
A small hand-verified excerpt used for automated tests lives under
test/corpus/ and retains the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license with attribution.

The notation reference in docs/notation.md is an independent description
of the charting shorthand, derived from the public Tennis Abstract
"Quick Start Guide" and the MatchChart instructions sheet.
